{"id": "34454", "title": "卖身娘子", "author": "橙星", "category": "文学名著", "count": 38, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34454.htm", "intro": "这年头什么都可以用卖身解决吗？卖身葬鸭、卖身诊鸡、卖身喂狗、卖身救乞、卖身还酒钱、卖身……木板上写满密密麻麻的字，除了最后一项“卖身葬父”他看得懂以外，其他完全超出了他的认知范围。这手里抱着一只鸡的姑娘，头壳坏掉了吗？不，头壳坏掉的是他，他竟然一时不忍真的把她买下来了！这下子可好了，她一路上救人、救狗、救蛇……钱不够就把自己一卖再卖，还可以分这次卖腿、下次卖手！不行！不准她再卖了，他一定要让她搞清楚，她已经完完全全地属于他了……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34454", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "2186810.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2186811.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2186812.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2186813.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2186814.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2186815.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2186816.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2186817.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2186818.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2186819.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2186820.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2186821.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2186822.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2186823.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2186824.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2186825.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2186826.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2186827.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2186828.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2186829.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2186830.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2186831.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2186832.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2186833.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2186834.html", "av